{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23045","headline":"重寄荔枝与杨使君时闻杨使君欲种植故有落句之戏 · 白居易","name":"重寄荔枝与杨使君时闻杨使君欲种植故有落句之戏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摘来正带凌晨露，寄去须凭下水船。\n映我绯衫浑不见，对公银印最相鲜。\n香连翠叶真堪画，红透青笼实可怜。\n闻道万州方欲种，愁君得吃是何年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}